    title: 'Flying Chit', desc: 'Play Flying Chit free in 3D: steer a winged paper chit through classroom bangles, build combos and earn coins to unlock new chit styles.',
    intro: 'Flying Chit is ChitPlay\'s own endless 3D game. A folded paper chit has grown two little wings and is gliding through a classroom that never ends. You steer it in every direction with the stick. It slowly runs out of lift, and only flying through the golden bangles keeps it in the air. Ceiling fans and stacks of books knock the paper out of it. The room gets faster and busier the further you go. Earn coins through play and spend them on new paper-chit looks; every style is cosmetic and keeps the same flight physics.',
    steps: ['Drag the stick, or use the arrow keys, W A S D or a gamepad, to steer the chit up, down, left and right.', 'A ring shows where your chit will cross the next bangle: it turns green when you are on target. Near a bangle the chit is drawn gently towards its middle.', 'Fly through a golden bangle to win back some lift. The bar under your score shows how much is left.', 'Bangles one after another build a combo: ×2, ×3, up to ×5 points each.', 'Missing a bangle ends the combo. Hitting a fan or a pile of books costs a lot of lift.', 'When the lift runs out the chit glides to the floor and your flight is over.', 'Every new level starts with a big golden bangle: 10 points and full lift.'],
