    steps: ["You see a clue (like Fruit or Sport) and the word as blank tiles, with one letter showing.","Another letter shows every second and a half. The last letter never shows, so you always have to guess.","Type the whole word on the letters keypad (or your keyboard) and press ✓. You get one guess per word.","Each phone times its own player, and friends' phones only ever see the letters already showing, never the word."],
