    faq: [["Which language are the words in?","The words are everyday English words, such as fruits, animals and things at home, so the game is also good English vocabulary practice."],["What happens if I guess wrong?","You score nothing for that word and wait for the next one. There is only one guess per word, so guessing too early is a risk."]],
